Keep a shared stops as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into stops.
Place 2 into stops.
Place 7 into stops.
Place 3 into stops.
Place 6 into stops.
Place 7 into stops.
Keep a shared begins as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into begins.
Place 3 into begins.
Keep a shared finishes as an empty list of whole numbers.
