Place 5 into finishes.
Keep a shared links as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 63.
Place 0 into links.

To connect from first (a whole number) with second (a whole number).
Set item (first times 8 plus second) of links to 1.
Set item (second times 8 plus first) of links to 1.

To weave from route (a whole number).
The start is item route of begins.
The finish is item route of finishes.
For every first from start to finish.
For every second from start to finish.
The leftstop is item first of stops.
The rightstop is item second of stops.
Connect from leftstop with rightstop.

For every route from 0 to 1.
Weave from route.

The visited is a list of 8 zeros.
The distances is a list of 8 zeros.
The queue is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into queue.
Set item 1 of visited to 1.
The head is 0.
The count is 1.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
For every other from 0 to 7.
If item (node times 8 plus other) of links is 1 and item other of visited is 0.
Set item other of visited to 1.
Set item other of distances to item node of distances plus 1.
Place other into queue.
Add 1 to count.

Show item 6 of distances.
